                    <p class="text-sm text-stone-600 mt-1">Convenience-related. Pleasant experience. This is where current products live. We need to move users to "Leveraging" through new use cases.</p>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>

        <!-- TAB: ARCHITECTURE -->
        <div id="tab-architecture" class="tab-content">
            <div class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-12 gap-6">
                <!-- Architecture Visualizer -->
                <div class="lg:col-span-8 bg-white rounded-lg p-6 rational-card">
                    <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold mb-2 text-stone-800">Tokenized UI Architecture</h2>
                    <p class="text-sm text-stone-500 mb-6">Visualizing the flow from User Context to Canonical Transaction via the Generative Layer.</p>
                    
                    <!-- Diagram Container -->
                    <div class="relative bg-stone-50 rounded-lg border border-stone-200 p-8 h-[400px] flex flex-col justify-between overflow-hidden">
                        
                        <!-- Top Layer: Canonical (The Goal) -->
                        <div class="flex justify-center mb-8">
                            <div class="bg-stone-800 text-white px-6 py-3 rounded shadow-lg z-10 w-64 text-center">
                                <div class="font-bold text-sm tracking-wider">CANONICAL JOURNEY</div>
                                <div class="text-[10px] text-stone-400">Formal • Deterministic • 100% Accurate</div>
                            </div>
                        </div>

                        <!-- Middle Layer: The Bridge (SimCity) -->
                        <div class="absolute top-1/2 left-0 right-0 h-24 bg-teal-50/50 border-y border-teal-100 flex items-center justify-center transform -translate-y-1/2">
                            <div class="flex items-center gap-4">
                                <div class="h-px bg-teal-300 w-12"></div>
                                <div class="bg-white border border-teal-200 text-teal-700 px-4 py-2 rounded text-xs font-bold shadow-sm">
                                    SAFE HARBOR SIMULATION
                                </div>
                                <div class="h-px bg-teal-300 w-12"></div>
                            </div>
                        </div>

                        <!-- Bottom Layer: Rhetorical (The User) -->
                        <div class="flex justify-between items-end mt-8 relative z-10">
                            <!-- Branch A -->
                            <div class="text-center group">
                                <div class="bg-white border border-stone-300 p-3 rounded mb-2 w-32 shadow-sm text-xs text-stone-600">
                                    "I need a loan for my shop"
                                </div>
                                <div class="h-16 w-0.5 bg-stone-300 mx-auto group-hover:bg-teal-500 transition-colors"></div>
                                <div class="text-[10px] font-bold text-stone-400 mt-2 uppercase">Informal Intent</div>
                            </div>

                            <!-- Branch B -->
                            <div class="text-center group">
                                <div class="bg-white border border-stone-300 p-3 rounded mb-2 w-32 shadow-sm text-xs text-stone-600">
                                    Local Language / Voice
                                </div>
                                <div class="h-16 w-0.5 bg-stone-300 mx-auto group-hover:bg-teal-500 transition-colors"></div>
                                <div class="text-[10px] font-bold text-stone-400 mt-2 uppercase">Multi-modal</div>
                            </div>

                            <!-- Branch C -->
                            <div class="text-center group">
                                <div class="bg-white border border-stone-300 p-3 rounded mb-2 w-32 shadow-sm text-xs text-stone-600">
                                    High Trust / Peer Assist
                                </div>
                                <div class="h-16 w-0.5 bg-stone-300 mx-auto group-hover:bg-teal-500 transition-colors"></div>
                                <div class="text-[10px] font-bold text-stone-400 mt-2 uppercase">Social Context</div>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                        
                        <!-- Flow Arrows (CSS overlay) -->
                        <div class="absolute inset-0 pointer-events-none flex justify-center items-end pb-24 opacity-20">
                            <div class="w-full h-full" style="background: radial-gradient(circle at bottom, rgba(20, 184, 166, 0.2) 0%, transparent 70%);"></div>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>

                <!-- Token Inspector -->
                <div class="lg:col-span-4 bg-white rounded-lg p-6 rational-card flex flex-col">
                    <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold mb-4 text-stone-800">UI Token Inspector</h2>
                    <p class="text-sm text-stone-600 mb-4">Unlike static Figma components, UI Tokens carry semantic weight.</p>
                    
                    <div class="bg-stone-900 rounded-lg p-4 font-mono text-xs text-green-400 overflow-hidden flex-grow shadow-inner">
                        <div class="mb-2 opacity-50">// Token Definition</div>
                        <div class="pl-0">{</div>
                        <div class="pl-4"><span class="text-purple-400">id</span>: "submit_btn_01",</div>
                        <div class="pl-4"><span class="text-purple-400">type</span>: "action",</div>
                        <div class="pl-4"><span class="text-blue-400">context_metadata</span>: {</div>
                        <div class="pl-8"><span class="text-yellow-400">literacy_req</span>: "low",</div>
                        <div class="pl-8"><span class="text-yellow-400">culture_code</span>: "IN-MH",</div>
                        <div class="pl-8"><span class="text-yellow-400">trust_signal</span>: "high"</div>
                        <div class="pl-4">},</div>
                        <div class="pl-4"><span class="text-blue-400">render_logic</span>: (user) => {</div>
                        <div class="pl-8 text-stone-400">// Morph based on user</div>
                        <div class="pl-8">if (user.isSkeptical) return "VoicePrompt";</div>
                        <div class="pl-8">return "StandardButton";</div>
                        <div class="pl-4">}</div>
                        <div class="pl-0">}</div>
                    </div>
                    <div class="mt-4">
                        <button onclick="toggleTokenLogic()" class="w-full py-2 bg-stone-100 hover:bg-stone-200 text-stone-700 text-sm font-medium rounded border border-stone-300">
                            Simulate Adaptation
                        </button>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>

        <!-- TAB: VALLEY OF TRUST -->
        <div id="tab-trust" class="tab-content">
            <div class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-2 gap-6">
                <!-- The Valley Chart -->
                <div class="bg-white rounded-lg p-6 rational-card">
                    <div class="flex justify-between items-center mb-4">
                        <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-stone-800">Crossing the Valley of Trust</h2>
                        <span class="text-xs bg-red-50 text-red-600 px-2 py-1 rounded border border-red-100">Liability Danger Zone</span>
                    </div>
                    <p class="text-sm text-stone-600 mb-6">Big Tech is stuck in "Assistive" mode. They fear errors destroying reputation.</p>
                    
                    <div class="chart-container">
                        <canvas id="trustChart"></canvas>
                    </div>
                </div>

                <!-- Simulation Log (SimCity) -->
                <div class="bg-white rounded-lg p-6 rational-card flex flex-col">
                    <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold mb-2 text-stone-800">Safe Harbor Simulation</h2>
                    <p class="text-sm text-stone-600 mb-4">The "SimCity" solution: Agents act freely in a sandbox until Trust Score > Threshold.</p>
                    
                    <div class="bg-black rounded-t-lg p-2 flex items-center gap-2 border-b border-stone-800">
                        <div class="w-3 h-3 rounded-full bg-red-500"></div>
                        <div class="w-3 h-3 rounded-full bg-yellow-500"></div>
                        <div class="w-3 h-3 rounded-full bg-green-500"></div>
